@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记患者付款与</u>\n<u>预付抵扣控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:患者付款</u>" as Payment
participant "<u>:应收账目</u>" as Bill
participant "<u>:付款分配</u>" as Allocation
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-07办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-07办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 登记已核实付款(患者、渠道、净额、交易依据)
activate Funds
Funds -> Payment : 确认到账(实际核实结果)
activate Payment
Payment --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Payment
opt 本次付款分配至账目
Funds -> Bill : 核对可分配额(目标账目及版本)
activate Bill
Bill --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Bill
Funds -> Payment : 分配已收款(各账目金额)
activate Payment
Payment -> Allocation : 形成分配(账目及金额)
activate Allocation
Allocation --> Payment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Allocation
Payment --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Payment
end
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Allocation
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
